OL,3,GNEWSAResidents rally to buy derelict
OL,4,Aland for community green
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of residents hoping to create a
OL,7,Fcommunity green in their town centre
OL,8,Fhave found a novel way to encourage
OL,9,Fpeople to back their project.
OL,11,FPeople in Warminster, Wiltshire, want
OL,12,Fto make a community green on derelict
OL,13,Fland at 3 High Street, next to St
OL,14,FLawrence's Chapel. The land is
OL,15,Fcurrently boarded up and behind a metal
OL,16,Fgate.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
