OL,3,GNEWSAResidents rally to buy derelict
OL,4,Aland for community green
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Warminster Community Green
OL,7,FAssociation is now offering the chance
OL,8,Ffor people to buy ''virtual square
OL,9,Ffeet", which, in return, lets them get
OL,10,Fa "virtual squareholder certificate"
OL,11,Fdesigned by local artist Rach Hornsey.
OL,13,F"We need a community space here," said
OL,14,Fthe group's Maggy Daniell. "We have a
OL,15,Flovely town park, but it's not in the
OL,16,Ftown centre."
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
